jkSIIKgtvOEkFW871/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=430&amp;face=0_0_640_430,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Lqnwy/hyWCPmbQg2/kCFUtCHmueRx4Tx86m6lZk/img.jpg?width=960&amp;height=1299&amp;face=0_0_960_1299\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">동아시아 과학 브랜드전: 유전학자 최정균 &amp; 물리학자 박권의 가장 뜨거운 과학 강연</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">www.aladin.co.kr</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 링크에서 강연 신청할 수 있습니다.^^</span></b></span><br>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e6b7b248307f712007edff97b4ddeab5fcdc92d2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e6b7b248307f712007edff97b4ddeab5fcdc92d2\" data-origin-width=\"1097\" data-origin-height=\"849\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">최정균 교수님 책은 아직 안 읽어봤고요(유전자 지배 사회)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">박권 교수님 책은 읽어봤어요(일어날 일은 일어난다)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">유전자 지배 사회 책이 핫하긴 합니다 ^^</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#39;일어날 일은 일어난다&#39; 책, <span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">개인적으로 </span>너무 좋게 와닿은 책이에요</span><br><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223315982520\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223315982520</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"추천하는 책 양자역학 [ 일어날 일은 일어난다 ] 도서 후기 - 누군가에게 딱 맞는 책이란? #과학고\" data-og-description=\"0. 이런 책을 많이 만나봐야 하는데.... 어떤 책을 읽으면 그동안 궁금해서 질문을 던지고, 스스로 답을 찾...\" data-og-host=\"blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223315982520\" data-og-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223315982520\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ch7PWa/hyWzxtWIWY/wMWmFKVuK9m5wLoDwpteF1/img.jpg?width=743&amp;height=1329&amp;face=0_0_743_1329\"><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223315982520\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223315982520\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ch7PWa/hyWzxtWIWY/wMWmFKVuK9m5wLoDwpteF1/img.jpg?width=743&amp;height=1329&amp;face=0_0_743_1329\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">추천하는 책 양자역학 [ 일어날 일은 일어난다 ] 도서 후기 - 누군가에게 딱 맞는 책이란? #과학고</p><p class=\"og-desc\">0. 이런 책을 많이 만나봐야 하는데.... 어떤 책을 읽으면 그동안 궁금해서 질문을 던지고, 스스로 답을 찾...</p><p class=\"og-host\">blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2개의 강연 다 보러 가고 싶은데,</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">일단 저는</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">아내의 허락을 받아야 하는 상황이라,</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">아직 허락받을 기회를 엿보고 있는 중입니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;그전에 매진(?)이 되진 않겠죠?</span><br><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c08095ea8ab9ee647a868123b212c442ade3b137\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c08095ea8ab9ee647a868123b212c442ade3b137\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"210\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/642ee99242a01e201d6359e5511926bef78b481f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/642ee99242a01e201d6359e5511926bef78b481f\" data-origin-width=\"1019\" data-origin-height=\"198\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
